WEBVTT

00:00:00.351 --> 00:00:15.911
On the canvas, the project switcher, the view switcher and the status bar float around the cards. When a long card opens, all of them blur together with the canvas, while the top bar stays sharp, and the card grows over the space they held, top and bottom.

00:00:20.364 --> 00:00:23.964
Closing the card brings the controls back, sharp and usable.
